# @agency-reality-checker

Pre-ship **checklist executor** — read-only builds, no feature creep.

## Verify

| Area | Command / doc |
|------|----------------|
| Tests | `ctest -C Release --output-on-failure` |
| VST3 | `pluginval --strictness-level 5` on Release bundle |
| FL | `disklordz-ralph/vst/docs/FL-STUDIO-QA.md` |
| Installer | `vst/installer/README.md` — `{commoncf64}\VST3` |
| Drag paths | Pad WAV + Shift+MIDI exist on disk after drag attempt |
| REA | `REA-WORKFLOW.md` — `processBlock` only, no full decompile |

## Report format

**Pass / fail / blocked** per row; link evidence files under `rea-notes/` or `docs/rea-audit.md`.

Reject launches with audio-thread alloc findings or missing pluginval.